@participant24 hi Frank, if you have time, could you please look into this issue? I guess you created this Integration…
There are now a number of people facing which look like a similar problem.
kind regards, Bert

@participant18  - It looks like I was just being a fool and failed to follow step 8 correctly. Updating here in case you had a similar hiccup:

By 'Enable the entity' the instrucitons **literally mean that the spotify entity is disabled** (I thought is was referring to the integration being disabled or something)  when first configured...
I just clicked on media_player.spotify_[my_name] -> Settings -> Advanced settings and selected entity stats "enabled" and everything is working. Apologies to those of you who tried to help me, hopefully this clarification helps people in the future! @participant19 might be useful to clarify that step on your original post for future reference, I imagine not everybody will scroll to the bottom (and hopefully I'm not the only one who made/will make that mistake)
